 "traps": [
  "only Jellyfin.Server and the API fuzz project use Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web; MediaBrowser.Common and MediaBrowser.Model reach ASP.NET Core through FrameworkReference, Jellyfin.Api through the Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization package",
  "versions are in Directory.Packages.props and the analyzers come from Directory.Build.props, which every project inherits: StyleCop and the other analyzers are not frameworks",
  "SQLite is the only database: Jellyfin.Database.Providers.Sqlite is the provider project; Microsoft.Data.Sqlite in Emby.Server.Implementations is its low-level driver",
  "the metadata services (TMDb, MusicBrainz, ListenBrainz, TheAudioDB, OMDb, Schedules Direct) are built-in provider plugins under MediaBrowser.Providers and src/Jellyfin.LiveTv, named by base URLs in code or by a client package",
  "there is no compose file in the repository; Prometheus scrapes the /metrics endpoint mapped in Startup.cs, and Graylog is a Serilog sink",
  "Swashbuckle, Serilog, SkiaSharp, AutoFixture and Moq are libraries, not listed; FsCheck and SharpFuzz are property-based and fuzz testing frameworks; the studio artwork downloaded from raw.githubusercontent.com is not listed as a service",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
